  "wants_video": false,
  "ig_caption": "He spent 6 months and £4,200 building an automation that broke every Tuesday. 🧨\n\nHis setup? Zapier stacked on spreadsheets, glued together with ChatGPT prompts and prayer.\n\nEvery Tuesday, a Zap timed out. Leads vanished. Invoices duplicated. His VA spent hours cleaning up the mess.\n\nWe rebuilt it in 9 days: N8N running the logic, GoHighLevel handling the CRM, Claude doing the thinking.\n\nZero breakages in 4 months. He got his Tuesdays back.\n\nCheap automation isn't cheap. It's the most expensive tax you'll ever pay.\n\nSound familiar? 👇\n\n#AIAutomation #N8N #GoHighLevel #BusinessAutomation #Entrepreneur #ClaudeAI #GoogleWorkspace #WorkflowAutomation #AIAgents #Accelod #Zapier #SmallBusinessOwner #DigitalTransformation #NoCode #LowCode #TechStack #StartupLife #SaaS #AITools #ProductivityHacks #ScaleYourBusiness #AutomationExpert #CRM #LeadGeneration #BusinessGrowth",
  "fb_caption": "He spent 6 months and £4,200 building an automation that broke every Tuesday.\n\nZapier stacked on spreadsheets, held together with ChatGPT prompts and hope.\n\nEvery week: timeouts, missing leads, duplicated invoices, a VA burning hours cleaning up.\n\nWe rebuilt the whole thing in 9 days. N8N for logic. GoHighLevel for CRM. Claude for the thinking.\n\nFour months in — zero breakages. He got his Tuesdays back.\n\nHere's the lesson: cheap automation is the most expensive kind. You pay for it in downtime, lost leads, and mental load.\n\nWhat's the duct-taped part of your business that keeps breaking?\n\n#AIAutomation #BusinessAutomation #Entrepreneur #Accelod",
